<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LEHMAN STARTS 2 PRISON STOCKS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LEHMAN STARTS 2 PRISON STOCKS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Kian Ghazi initiated coverage of two prison stocks.</p>
<p>-- put buy rating and 12-to-18-month $60 price target on Corrections Corp of America, which manages prison and other correctional institutions for government agencies.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 9/16 to 42-5/8.</p>
<p>-- put outperform rating on CCA Prison Realty Trust, a real estate investment trust of privatized corrections facilities.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 1/16 to 30-7/8.</p>
</text>
